{"bookId":"haggai","version":"kjv-strong","source":"eBible KJV2006 USFM","chapters":{"1":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"In the second year of Darius the king, in the sixth month, in the first day of the month, came the word of the LORD by Haggai the prophet unto Zerubbabel the son of Shealtiel, governor of Judah, and to Joshua the son of Josedech, the high priest, saying,","tokens":[{"text":"In the"},{"text":"second","strongs":["H8147"]},{"text":"year","strongs":["H8141"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Darius","strongs":["H1867"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"king","strongs":["H4428"]},{"text":", in the"},{"text":"sixth","strongs":["H8345"]},{"text":"month","strongs":["H2320"]},{"text":", in the"},{"text":"first","strongs":["H0259"]},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"month","strongs":["H2320"]},{"text":", came the"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"by","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"Haggai","strongs":["H2292"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"prophet","strongs":["H5030"]},{"text":"unto"},{"text":"Zerubbabel","strongs":["H2216"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"son","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Shealtiel","strongs":["H7597"]},{"text":","},{"text":"governor","strongs":["H6346"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Judah","strongs":["H3063"]},{"text":", and to"},{"text":"Joshua","strongs":["H3091"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"son","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Josedech","strongs":["H3087"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"high","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"priest","strongs":["H3548"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saying","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":2,"text":"Thus speaketh the LORD of hosts, saying, This people say, The time is not come, the time that the LORD’s house should be built.","tokens":[{"text":"Thus"},{"text":"speaketh","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saying","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", This"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", The"},{"text":"time","strongs":["H6256"]},{"text":"is not"},{"text":"come","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"time","strongs":["H6256"]},{"text":"that the"},{"text":"LORD’s","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"house","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"should be"},{"text":"built","strongs":["H1129"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"Then came the word of the LORD by Haggai the prophet, saying,","tokens":[{"text":"Then came the"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"by","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"Haggai","strongs":["H2292"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"prophet","strongs":["H5030"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saying","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":4,"text":"Is it time for you, O ye, to dwell in your cieled houses, and this house lie waste?","tokens":[{"text":"Is it"},{"text":"time","strongs":["H6256"]},{"text":"for you, O ye, to"},{"text":"dwell","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"in your"},{"text":"cieled","strongs":["H5603"]},{"text":"houses","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":", and this"},{"text":"house","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"lie"},{"text":"waste","strongs":["H2720"]},{"text":"?"}]},{"number":5,"text":"Now therefore thus saith the LORD of hosts; Consider your ways.","tokens":[{"text":"Now therefore thus"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":";"},{"text":"Consider","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"your"},{"text":"ways","strongs":["H1870"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"Ye have sown much, and bring in little; ye eat, but ye have not enough; ye drink, but ye are not filled with drink; ye clothe you, but there is none warm; and he that earneth wages earneth wages to put it into a bag with holes.","tokens":[{"text":"Ye have"},{"text":"sown","strongs":["H2232"]},{"text":"much","strongs":["H7235"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"bring","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"little","strongs":["H4592"]},{"text":"; ye"},{"text":"eat","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":", but ye have not"},{"text":"enough","strongs":["H7654"]},{"text":"; ye"},{"text":"drink","strongs":["H8354"]},{"text":", but ye are not filled with"},{"text":"drink","strongs":["H7937"]},{"text":"; ye"},{"text":"clothe","strongs":["H3847"]},{"text":"you, but there is none"},{"text":"warm","strongs":["H2527"]},{"text":"; and he that earneth"},{"text":"wages","strongs":["H7936"]},{"text":"earneth"},{"text":"wages","strongs":["H7936"]},{"text":"to put it into a"},{"text":"bag","strongs":["H6872"]},{"text":"with"},{"text":"holes","strongs":["H5344"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":7,"text":"Thus saith the LORD of hosts; Consider your ways.","tokens":[{"text":"Thus"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":";"},{"text":"Consider","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"your"},{"text":"ways","strongs":["H1870"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"Go up to the mountain, and bring wood, and build the house; and I will take pleasure in it, and I will be glorified, saith the LORD.","tokens":[{"text":"Go"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5927"]},{"text":"to the"},{"text":"mountain","strongs":["H2022"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"bring","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"wood","strongs":["H6086"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"build","strongs":["H1129"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"house","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"; and I will take"},{"text":"pleasure","strongs":["H7521"]},{"text":"in it, and I will be"},{"text":"glorified","strongs":["H3513"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"Ye looked for much, and, lo, it came to little; and when ye brought it home, I did blow upon it. Why? saith the LORD of hosts. Because of mine house that is waste, and ye run every man unto his own house.","tokens":[{"text":"Ye"},{"text":"looked","strongs":["H6437"]},{"text":"for"},{"text":"much","strongs":["H7235"]},{"text":", and, lo, it came to"},{"text":"little","strongs":["H4592"]},{"text":"; and when ye"},{"text":"brought","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"it"},{"text":"home","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":", I did"},{"text":"blow","strongs":["H5301"]},{"text":"upon it. Why?"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Because","strongs":["H3282"]},{"text":"of mine"},{"text":"house","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"that is"},{"text":"waste","strongs":["H2720"]},{"text":", and ye"},{"text":"run","strongs":["H7323"]},{"text":"every"},{"text":"man","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"unto his own"},{"text":"house","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"Therefore the heaven over you is stayed from dew, and the earth is stayed from her fruit.","tokens":[{"text":"Therefore the"},{"text":"heaven","strongs":["H8064"]},{"text":"over you is"},{"text":"stayed","strongs":["H3607"]},{"text":"from"},{"text":"dew","strongs":["H2919"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"stayed","strongs":["H3607"]},{"text":"from her"},{"text":"fruit","strongs":["H2981"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":11,"text":"And I called for a drought upon the land, and upon the mountains, and upon the corn, and upon the new wine, and upon the oil, and upon that which the ground bringeth forth, and upon men, and upon cattle, and upon all the labour of the hands.","tokens":[{"text":"And I"},{"text":"called","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"for a"},{"text":"drought","strongs":["H2721"]},{"text":"upon the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":", and upon the"},{"text":"mountains","strongs":["H2022"]},{"text":", and upon the"},{"text":"corn","strongs":["H1715"]},{"text":", and upon the 