text":"strong","strongs":["H2388"]},{"text":", all ye"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"work","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":": for I am with you,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":":"}]},{"number":5,"text":"According to the word that I covenanted with you when ye came out of Egypt, so my spirit remaineth among you: fear ye not.","tokens":[{"text":"According to the"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"that I"},{"text":"covenanted","strongs":["H3772"]},{"text":"with you when ye"},{"text":"came","strongs":["H3318"]},{"text":"out of"},{"text":"Egypt","strongs":["H4714"]},{"text":", so my"},{"text":"spirit","strongs":["H7307"]},{"text":"remaineth","strongs":["H5975"]},{"text":"among","strongs":["H8432"]},{"text":"you:"},{"text":"fear","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":"ye not."}]},{"number":6,"text":"For thus saith the LORD of hosts; Yet once, it is a little while, and I will shake the heavens, and the earth, and the sea, and the dry land;","tokens":[{"text":"For thus"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"; Yet"},{"text":"once","strongs":["H0259"]},{"text":", it is a little"},{"text":"while","strongs":["H4592"]},{"text":", and I will"},{"text":"shake","strongs":["H7493"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"heavens","strongs":["H8064"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"dry","strongs":["H2724"]},{"text":"land;"}]},{"number":7,"text":"And I will shake all nations, and the desire of all nations shall come: and I will fill this house with glory, saith the LORD of host