ninth month, in the second year of Darius, came the word of the LORD by Haggai the prophet, saying,","tokens":[{"text":"In the"},{"text":"four","strongs":["H0702"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"twentieth","strongs":["H6242"]},{"text":"day of the"},{"text":"ninth","strongs":["H8671"]},{"text":"month, in the"},{"text":"second","strongs":["H8147"]},{"text":"year","strongs":["H8141"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Darius","strongs":["H1867"]},{"text":", came the"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"by","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"Haggai","strongs":["H2292"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"prophet","strongs":["H5030"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saying","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":11,"text":"Thus saith the LORD of hosts; Ask now the priests concerning the law, saying,","tokens":[{"text":"Thus"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":";"},{"text":"Ask","strongs":["H7592"]},{"text":"now the"},{"text":"priests","strongs":["H3548"]},{"text":"concerning the"},{"text":"law","strongs":["H8451"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saying","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":12,"text":"If one bear holy flesh in the skirt of his garment, and with his skirt do touch bread, or pottage, or wine, or oil, or any meat, shall it be holy? And the priests answered and said, No.","tokens":[{"text":"If"},{"text":"one","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"bear","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":"holy","strongs":["H6944"]},{"text":"flesh","strongs":["H1320"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"skirt","strongs":["H3671"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"garment","strongs":["H0899"]},{"text":", and with his"},{"text":"skirt","strongs":["H3671"]},{"text":"do"},{"text":"touch","strongs":["H5060"]},{"text":"bread","strongs":["H3899"]},{"text":", or"},{"text":"pottage","strongs":["H5138"]},{"text":", or"},{"text":"wine","strongs":["H3196"]},{"text":", or"},{"text":"oil","strongs":["H8081"]},{"text":", or any"},{"text":"meat","strongs":["H3978"]},{"text":", shall it be"},{"text":"holy","strongs":["H6942"]},{"text":"? And the"},{"text":"priests","strongs":["H3548"]},{"text":"answered","strongs":["H6030"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", No."}]},{"number":13,"text":"Then said Haggai, If one that is unclean by a dead body touch any of these, shall it be unclean? And the priests answered and said, It shall be unclean.","tokens":[{"text":"Then"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"Haggai","strongs":["H2292"]},{"text":", If one that is"},{"text":"unclean","strongs":["H2931"]},{"text":"by a dead"},{"text":"body","strongs":["H5315"]},{"text":"touch","strongs":["H5060"]},{"text":"any of these, shall it be"},{"text":"unclean","strongs":["H2930"]},{"text":"? And the"},{"text":"priests","strongs":["H3548"]},{"text":"answered","strongs":["H6030"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", It shall be"},{"text":"unclean","strongs":["H2930"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":14,"text":"Then answered Haggai, and said, So is this people, and so is this nation before me, saith the LORD; and so is every work of their hands; and that which they offer there is unclean.","tokens":[{"text":"Then"},{"text":"answered","strongs":["H6030"]},{"text":"Haggai","strongs":["H2292"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", So is this"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":", and so is this"},{"text":"nation","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"before","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"me,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"; and so is every"},{"text":"work","strongs":["H4639"]},{"text":"of their"},{"text":"hands","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"; and that which they"},{"text":"offer","strongs":["H7126"]},{"text":"there is"},{"text":"unclean","strongs":["H2931"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":15,"text":"And now, I pray you, consider from this day and upward, from before a stone was laid upon a stone in the temple of the LORD:","tokens":[{"text":"And now, I pray you,"},{"text":"consider","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"from this"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"upward","strongs":["H4605"]},{"text":", from"},{"text":"before","strongs":["H2962"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"stone","strongs":["H0068"]},{"text":"was"},{"text":"laid","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"upon a"},{"text":"stone","strongs":["H0068"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"temple","strongs":["H1964"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":":"}]},{"number":16,"text":"Since those days were, when one came to an heap of twenty measures, there were but ten: when one came to the pressfat for to draw out fifty vessels out of the press, there were but twenty.","tokens":[{"text":"Since those days were, when one"},{"text":"came","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"to an"},{"text":"heap","strongs":["H6194"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"twenty","strongs":["H6242"]},{"text":"measures, there were but"},{"text":"ten","strongs":["H6235"]},{"text":": when one"},{"text":"came","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"to the"},{"text":"pressfat","strongs":["H3342"]},{"text":"for to draw"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H2834"]},{"text":"fifty","strongs":["H2572"]},{"text":"vessels out of the"},{"text":"press","strongs":["H6333"]},{"text":", there were but"},{"text":"twenty","strongs":["H6242"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":17,"text":"I smote you with blasting and with mildew and with hail in all the labours of your hands; yet ye turned not to me, saith the LORD.","tokens":[{"text":"I"},{"text":"smote","strongs":["H5221"]},{"text":"you with"},{"text":"blasting","strongs":["H7711"]},{"text":"and with"},{"text":"mildew","strongs":["H3420"]},{"text":"and with"},{"text":"hail","strongs":["H1259"]},{"text":"in all the"},{"text":"labours","strongs":["H4639"]},{"text":"of your"},{"text":"hands","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"; yet ye turned not to me,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":18,"text":"Consider now from this day and upward, from the four and twentieth day of the ninth month, even from the day that the foundation of the LORD’s temple was laid, consider it.","tokens":[{"text":"Consider","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"now from this"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"upward","strongs":["H4605"]},{"text":", from the"},{"text":"four","strongs":["H0702"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"twentieth","strongs":["H6242"]},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"ninth","strongs":["H8671"]},{"text":"month, even from the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"that the"},{"text":"foundation","strongs":["H3245"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD’s","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"temple","strongs":["H1964"]},{"text":"was laid,"},{"text":"consider","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"it."}]},{"number":19,"text":"Is the seed yet in the barn? yea, as yet the vine, and the fig tree, and the pomegranate, and the olive tree, hath not brought forth: from this day will I bless you.","tokens":[{"text":"Is the"},{"text":"seed","strongs":["H2233"]},{"text":"yet in the"},{"text":"barn","strongs":["H4035"]},{"text":"? yea, as yet the"},{"text":"vine","strongs":["H1612"]},{"text":", and the fig"},{"text":"tree","strongs":["H8384"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"pomegranate","strongs":["H7416"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"olive","strongs":["H2132"]},{"text":"tree","strongs":["H6086"]},{"text":", hath not brought"},{"text":"forth","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":": from this"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"will I"},{"text":"bless","strongs":["H1288"]},{"text":"you."}]},{"number":20,"text":"And again the word of the LORD came unto Haggai in the four and twentieth day of the month, saying,","tokens":[{"text":"And"},{"text":"again","strongs":["H8145"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"came unto"},{"text":"Haggai","strongs":["H2292"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"four","strongs":["H0702"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"twentieth","strongs":["H6242"]},{"text":"day of the"},{"text":"month","strongs":["H2320"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saying","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":21,"text":"Speak to Zerubbabel, governor of Judah, saying, I will shake the heavens and the earth;","tokens":[{"text":"Speak","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"Zerubbabel","strongs":["H2216"]},{"text":","},{"text":"governor","strongs":["H6346"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Judah","strongs":["H3063"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saying","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", I will"},{"text":"shake","strongs":["H7493"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"heavens","strongs":["H8064"]},{"text":"and the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":22,"text":"And I will overthrow the throne of kingdoms, and I will destroy the strength of the kingdoms of the heathen; and I will overthrow the chariots, and those that ride in them; and the horses and their riders shall come down, every one by the sword of his brother.","tokens":[{"text":"And I will"},{"text":"overthrow","strongs":["H2015"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"throne","strongs":["H3678"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"kingdoms","strongs":["H4467"]},{"text":", and I will"},{"text":"destroy","strongs":["H8045"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"strength","strongs":["H2392"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"kingdoms","strongs":["H4467"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"heathen","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"; and I will"},{"text":"overthrow","strongs":["H2015"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"chariots","strongs":["H4818"]},{"text":", and those that"},{"text":"ride","strongs":["H7392"]},{"text":"in them; and the"},{"text":"horses","strongs":["H5483"]},{"text":"and their"},{"text":"riders","strongs":["H7392"]},{"text":"shall come"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H3381"]},{"text":", every"},{"text":"one","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"by the"},{"text":"sword","strongs":["H2719"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"brother","strongs":["H0251"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":23,"text":"In that day, saith the LORD of hosts, will I take thee, O Zerubbabel, my servant, the son of Shealtiel, saith the LORD, and will make thee as a signet: for I have chosen thee, saith the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"In that"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":", will I"},{"text":"take","strongs":["H3947"]},{"text":"thee, O"},{"text":"Zerubbabel","strongs":["H2216"]},{"text":", my"},{"text":"servant","strongs":["H5650"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"son","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Shealtiel","strongs":["H7597"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", and will"},{"text":"make","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"thee as a"},{"text":"signet","strongs":["H2368"]},{"text":": for I have"},{"text":"chosen","strongs":["H0977"]},{"text":"thee,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]}]}}}